<title>USA: Tupelo, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Tupelo, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $1.600 million of Tupelo, Miss., general obligation park bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.56 percent.</p>
</text>
